      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also experiencing this issue.\n\nWhen editing notes from the web page, the existing note content is not loaded into the editor, so it is very easy to accidentally overwrite and lose previous notes.\n\nAs far as I remember, older versions of the website preserved the existing note content correctly while editing, so this may be a regression.",
