  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On the vrchat website, if you want to edit the notes you made on a user, it only lets you replace it completely and not let it add stuff anymore to your old notes. That's very annoying if you keep track of users for servers or if you want to keep track of rippers. If you just want to add a few things to your note, you have to completely rewrite everything now. (Only notes that got created before the newest website update). You sadly can not even copy the old note first, so that you can just copy past it and THEN write your extra note. Please fix that!♡",
